     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p><strong>4/20 Is Almost Here!</strong></p><p>Highway 90 is celebrating all weekend long from <strong>April 17th–20th</strong> with storewide deals, giveaways, vendor popups, goodie bags &amp; more. You won’t want to miss it 🔥</p><p>Stock up, try something new, and take advantage before these deals are gone.</p><p>Storewide deals up to 40% off + More savings on your favorite products 50-60% Off!</p><p><strong>🚚</strong><strong>Food Trucks:</strong></p><p>🧀4/18: Cheesesteaks From <strong>Jeremiah’s Food Truck</strong></p><p>☕4/19:<strong> Travelin’ Tom’s Coffee</strong> + Bagels provided by Highway 90</p><p>☕4/20:<strong> Free Will Coffee</strong></p><p>🌭4/20:<strong>Rocks Dogs Hot Dogs</strong></p><p><strong>🛍️Goodie Bags:</strong></p><p>First 50 Customers at 9am and 4:20pm Saturday, 4/18</p><p>First 50 Customers at 9am and 4:20pm Monday, 4/20</p><p><strong>🍃</strong><strong>Deals:</strong></p><p>Don’t miss storewide 4/20 deals—save up to 40% off, plus even deeper discounts of 50%, 60%, and 70% on your favorite products! Join Highway 90 this 4/20 weekend and stock up while the savings last.</p>"
