       "html": "<p>But when THE April 20th celebration rolls around we get even more excited! Originating in the 1970s among a group of high school students, this day has blossomed into a worldwide celebration of cannabis culture and advocacy for its legalization. And here at Highway 90 Dispensary, we’re buzzing with anticipation to make this 420 unforgettable for you in NJ! So, what are you waiting for? Drop by our dispensary and join in on the festivities! Let’s make this year’s celebration one for the books!</p>"
